<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_polar__coordinates_8hpp">glm/gtx/polar_coordinates.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Conversion from Euclidean space to polar space and revert.</para>
</section>
